In this directory you can find stuff for various distributions.
If you can't find something for your distro(TM) - let us know or
(best) mail to us the solution <dc-hub@ds.pg.gda.pl>

MandrakeLinux/	- stuff for Mandrake Linux Distribution	http://www.mandrake-linux.com/
PLD/		- stuff for PLD Linux Distribution	http://www.pld-linux.org/
README		- this file
dcd.sysconfig	- file with system configuration (usually in /etc/sysconfig)
logrotate.dcd	- file for logrotate
